Attribution note on the redistributed files
--------------------------------------------

Four files here are byte-identical redistributions from the PRIYA emulator
release:

    emulator_params.json
    hires/emulator_params.json
    mf_emulator_flux_vectors_tau1000000.hdf5        (published as *_cut.hdf5)
    hires/mf_emulator_flux_vectors_tau1000000.hdf5  (published as *_cut.hdf5)

They originate with the PRIYA suite and its authors. The two res_corr/ files
listed in the README provenance table are also byte-identical to files in
jibanCat/InferenceLyaData, but they are our own derived resolution-convergence
table rather than part of the PRIYA release, which is why they are not listed
here.

The CC BY 4.0 grant in LICENSE applies to this collection and to the trained
GPs, the verifier and the documentation that we add. Please cite the PRIYA
suite paper above when you use the redistributed files.
